Scope note / محدودهٔ مجوز

This MIT license covers the original code in this repository (applications,
engine, tooling, documentation and media that were produced for this project).

Third-party material is NOT relicensed by this file:

* `library/**` and the skills vendored from upstream repositories keep their
  upstream licenses. Provenance and the license of every vendored repository
  are recorded in `library/github-skills/PROVENANCE.json` and
  `docs/audit/starred-repos-2026-11.csv`.
* Any dependency installed from npm/PyPI keeps its own license; the generated
  inventory is `docs/audit/sbom.cdx.json`.
* Images, fonts and brand assets keep the terms stated next to them
  (`brand/`, `brands/`, `bison-brand-book/`, `viking-team/`).

If a vendored folder carries its own `LICENSE`, that file wins for that folder.
